                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.113/9307: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Mexico</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-03-07T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1922—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>34. Your 32, March 6, 5 p.m. Department has today made public that embargo will
                    not be renewed at this time.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
